summary:
  A row edited on the settings page keeps itself whole, and nothing the
  popup wrote to it meanwhile lands.

history:
  A rename on the page and a heal in the popup left the renamed station on
  the address the heal had left, and the popup's next load lost its
  favorite. What was changed on the page now wins field by field, and the
  rest follows the popup.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ReorderLogic.js

find:
              var both = _fieldMerge(b, c, x)

replace:
              var both = c

expect:
  Killed by tst_reorderlogic::test_merge_carries_a_move_onto_a_row_renamed_here.
  Line-neutral.
